    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29908" root="عقر" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقِرٌ</span></b> : fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقِرَةٌ</span>: see the latter voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقِيرٌ</span>: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاقِرٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ عَقِرَةٌ</span>, accord. to the K, <i>A
she-camel that will not drink save from fear:</i> but
accord. to IAar [and the S and O], <i>that will not
drink save from the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقْر</span> <i>of the trough,</i> or <i>tank;</i>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزِيَةٌ</span> signifies one “ that will not drink save
from its <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِزَآء</span>, ” i. e. “ from its fore part. ” (TA.)

